    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Agreeing",
     "texto": [
      "**Zgadzasz się ze mną?** means «do you agree with me?».",
      "**Zgadzam się** is «I agree»; the preposition **z/ze** takes the form **mną** here."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Giving a reason",
     "texto": [
      "**Ponieważ** introduces a cause («because»); **chociaż** presents a contrast («although»).",
      "After a disagreement we can **szukać kompromisu** («look for a middle ground»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
